+
+Request: users report applyPatch accepting patches they consider invalid, surprising edge cases, and
+failures not matching RFC 6902. Review how patches are checked and applied and make behaviour conform,
+errors included.
+
+Done: operations are iterated with an index loop (sparse-array holes were silently skipped and are now
+rejected); `op`, `path` and `from` are read only as own members of the operation object. Tests added in
+test/patch.test.ts.
